codex
The complete table is written. The build again hit the sandbox-specific Lean launcher issue before elaboration (`/proc/<pid>/exe` is hidden), so I’m reusing the same temporary, process-local `/proc/self/exe` compatibility shim; no project or toolchain file is being changed.
